    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">30 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n          <span class=\"chip k8s\">Kubernetes</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Twitter/X</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Meta</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Atlassian</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Razorpay</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Trending Topics (Twitter/X)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Out of thousands of posts per second, find the handful of topics that are <i>suddenly</i> being talked about in each country and city - in about a minute, without being fooled by \"good morning\" or by a bot army.</p>\n      "
